# Paths excluded from the public source mirror.
#
# `export-ignore` affects `git archive` only, which is how scripts/sync-public.sh
# builds each public snapshot. Nothing here changes this repository, a checkout,
# a build or a test run.

# A separate experimental program with its own build and gates; CLAUDE.md says
# it is not part of this app.
tui/                            export-ignore

# Internal agent config and architecture notes.
.claude/                        export-ignore
CLAUDE.md                       export-ignore

# .github/workflows/release.yml is deliberately NOT excluded: the dmg is built
# on the mirror, from a release cut there, so the workflow has to reach it. It
# guards itself with `if: github.repository` so it never runs here. Note that a
# file cannot be added to the mirror directly — a snapshot replaces its whole
# tree — so anything that must exist there has to be published from here.

# The mirror machinery itself.
scripts/sync-public.sh          export-ignore
